n\nVPORT contains streamed experiences and requires a high-quality internet connection. Interrupted connectivity may cause latency or discomfort. Streamed content is provided by VPORT and may not always be available.", "short_description": "Discover live and on-demand concerts, browse artists and venues, and watch in 2D or immersive 180\u00b0/360\u00b0 on Meta Quest. VPORT contains streamed experiences and requires a high-quality internet connection. Streamed content is provided by VPORT and may not always be available."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://thevport.com/policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://thevport.com/terms", "publisher_name": "VPORT LLC", "support_website_url": "https://thevport.com/contact-us", "website_url": "https://thevport.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "2687655338230691"}, {"id": "1228796255027646"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING", "GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "35798886733090072"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1031665722826447"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1031665722826447"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1791150180, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1031665722826447"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "389504960279291